sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Operator
    participant UI as React 18 UI Component
    participant Axios as Axios / API Client (client.js)
    participant RateLimit as Express Rate Limiter
    participant Security as Helmet & MongoSanitize
    participant Auth as JWT Auth Middleware
    participant Validator as Express-Validator
    participant Ctrl as Controller
    participant Svc as Business Service
    participant Model as Mongoose Model / MongoDB

    User->>UI: Submits Form / Action
    UI->>Axios: Dispatches API Request (with x-idempotency-key)
    Axios->>RateLimit: HTTP Request (Headers + Body)
    RateLimit-->>Axios: 429 Too Many Requests (if exceeded)
    RateLimit->>Security: Sanitizes input & verifies origin
    Security->>Auth: Verifies Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Auth-->>Axios: 401 Unauthorized (if missing/expired)
    Auth->>Validator: Validates schema & parameters
    Validator-->>Axios: 400 Bad Request (if validation fails)
    Validator->>Ctrl: Hands off validated & sanitized data
    Ctrl->>Svc: Invokes business logic & calculations
    Svc->>Model: Queries / Transactions (Atomic Session)
    Model-->>Svc: Persisted Documents / State
    Svc-->>Ctrl: Processed Output / Aggregate
    Ctrl-->>Axios: HTTP 200/201 JSON / Stream (PDF/XLSX)
    Axios-->>UI: Resolves Promise with ApiResponse payload
    UI-->>User: Updates React State / Triggers Toast / Renders View
